      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While hydration and some supplements can support recovery, attempting to self-diagnose and treat heart palpitations without a proper checkup is risky, especially with chest heaviness. Since you are concerned about your heart racing and breathlessness, these symptoms should be professionally assessed before you try supplements. For immediate, non-medical support, focus on absolute rest and avoiding any strenuous activity until you can see a doctor.",
      "source": "target",
